cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this testbed, its protocol or its results, please cite the
  software entry below and the dataset it produced.
title: >-
  Federated Agent Messaging: a Matrix testbed for persistent human-agent
  interaction across federation domains
abstract: >-
  A reproducible two-domain Matrix/Synapse testbed and frozen experimental
  protocol for evaluating whether a federated messaging system can serve as a
  persistent shared interaction substrate for humans and autonomous agents.
  Contains the implementation, the frozen research documents, the protocol
  lock the formal campaign executed under, the analysis code, and the processed
  results and figures derived from the archived raw observations.
